{'symbol': 'AMP', 'date': '2022-11-29 12:00:00', 'title': "TWO ADVISORS WITH NEARLY $150 MILLION IN ASSETS JOIN AMERIPRISE FOR ‘BEST-IN-CLASS TECHNOLOGY'", 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS--( BUSINESS WIRE )--AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL, INC. (NYSE: AMP) RECENTLY ADDED TWO ADVISORS TO ITS INDEPENDENT CHANNEL WITH NEARLY $150 MILLION IN CLIENT ASSETS. JASON CRANE, JD, CFP® AND GERRY OWEN, CPA, WHO OPERATE CRANE & OWEN FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS IN AIKEN, SOUTH CAROLINA, MOVED THEIR PRACTICE FROM EDWARD JONES. AMERIPRISE BECAME THE TOP CHOICE FOR THEIR PRACTICE AFTER THEY LEARNED MORE ABOUT THE ROBUST RESOURCES AND FLEXIBILITY THE FIRM PROVIDES TO HELP ADVISORS SERVE CLIENTS AND GROW THEIR BUSINESSES.'}